  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 1302.03 “Licensed pharmacist” or “pharmacist” means “licensed pharmacist” or “pharmacist” as defined in RSA 318:1, VII, namely, “when not otherwise limited, means a person holding a license under RSA 318:18 and who is, therefore legally authorized to practice the profession of pharmacy in this state.”\n\nSource. #9552, eff 9-23-09; ss by #10185, eff 9-18-12; ss by #13558, eff 4-12-23 (formerly Ph 1302.02)",
